  unitName: Flora Princess Faris
  unitId: 30463
  unitNumber: 661
  description: The second princess of the Principality of Vriksha who fled after
    encountering an attack from the god army. Completely differing from her reserved
    elder sister, Princess Lidith, she was known for having a boisterous personality.
    Faris was willing to fight to the end once the principality started to crumble,
    but after speaking with her elder sister, she decided to flee with bodyguard
    Lario. Afterwards, Lario suffered an altercation while on duty, which drove them
    to escape. This only served to further damage her pride, leading her to draw
    her treasure sword to face off against the gods.
  summonDesc: Summoner or not, you must<br>address me like a princess.<br>I'm not
    asking.<br>That was an order.
  fusionDesc: Hmm...<br>It's easier than I thought!<br>I'll forgive you for making
    me stronger.
